# Engineering Protocol

These documents define the shared engineering discipline for @REPOSITORY_NAME@:

- `implementation-standard.md`: scope, design, dependency, portability, and review rules.
- `testing-standard.md`: risk-based testing and local validation.
- `worker-protocol.md`: branch, commit, blocker, and handoff behavior.
- `feature-spec.md`: the minimum contract for an implementation-ready CTO specification.

Repository architecture remains repository-owned. Shared engineering protocol does not replace domain architecture documents.
